{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "z-salon-finance-expense-refund-20261005",
    "name": "Z-Salon API — Finance, Expense & Refunds",
    "description": "Postman collection for the Z-Salon finance, expense and refund endpoints.\n\nCovers:\n- Expense: categories, ledger, payments, void\n- Finance Reports: summary, revenue, collections, refunds, outstanding, expenses (GET-only)\n- Refunds: admin queue (list/get/approve/reject/create/complete), refundable balance\n- Per-appointment financials and customer outstanding\n\n## Setup\n1. Set `baseUrl` and `businessId` in collection variables.\n2. Run **Auth › Login** first — it captures `accessToken` automatically.\n3. Create a branch, customer, service, staff and payment method, then capture their IDs from responses (scripts are included on key requests).\n\n## Time Handling\n- All datetimes in request bodies must be **ISO 8601** (e.g. `2026-10-15T10:00:00.000+03:00` — Ethiopia is GMT+3 / Africa/Addis_Ababa).\n- `from`/`to` accept either full ISO datetime or plain `YYYY-MM-DD`; date-only bounds span the whole day in the business timezone.\n- Responses return ISO 8601 UTC (`Z`).\n- Currency amounts are decimal strings with 2 dp.\n\nFull reference: `docs/ENDPOINTS-GUIDE-FINANCE.md`.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json",
    "_exporter_id": "z-salon-backend"
  },
  "variable": [
    { "key": "baseUrl", "value": "http://localhost:3000/api/v1", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "accessToken", "value": "", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "businessId", "value": "REPLACE_WITH_BUSINESS_ID", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "branchId", "value": "REPLACE_WITH_BRANCH_ID", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "customerId", "value": "REPLACE_WITH_CUSTOMER_ID", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "customerPhone", "value": "+251912345678", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "serviceId", "value": "REPLACE_WITH_SERVICE_ID", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "staffId", "value": "REPLACE_WITH_STAFF_ID", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "appointmentId", "value": "REPLACE_WITH_APPOINTMENT_ID", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "paymentMethodId", "value": "REPLACE_WITH_PAYMENT_METHOD_ID", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "usageId", "value": "REPLACE_WITH_USAGE_ID", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "paymentId", "value": "REPLACE_WITH_PAYMENT_ID", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "refundRequestId", "value": "REPLACE_WITH_REFUND_REQUEST_ID", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "categoryId", "value": "REPLACE_WITH_CATEGORY_ID", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "expenseId", "value": "REPLACE_WITH_EXPENSE_ID", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "availabilityDate", "value": "2026-10-15", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "bookingStart", "value": "2026-10-15T09:00:00.000+03:00", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "verificationToken", "value": "", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "feedbackToken", "value": "REPLACE_FEEDBACK_TOKEN", "type": "string" }
  ],
  "auth": {
    "type": "bearer",
    "bearer": [{ "key": "token", "value": "{{accessToken}}", "type": "string" }]
  },
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "1. Auth",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Login",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"phone\": \"+251911000000\",\n  \"password\": \"Str0ngPass1\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/login",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["auth", "login"]
            },
            "description": "Returns `accessToken` (use it as `Authorization: Bearer …`) and sets the `refreshToken` cookie. Writes `accessToken` into collection variables."
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "if (responseCode.code === 200) {",
                  "  let json = pm.response.json();",
                  "  if (json?.data?.accessToken) { pm.collectionVariables.set('accessToken', json.data.accessToken); }",
                  "}"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "2. Expense — Categories",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Create category",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"name\": \"Rent\",\n  \"description\": \"Studio rent\",\n  \"isActive\": true\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/businesses/{{businessId}}/expense-categories",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["businesses", "{{businessId}}", "expense-categories"]
            },
            "description": "Auth: Bearer + membership + FINANCE_RECORD_EXPENSE"
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "if (responseCode.code === 201) {",
                  "  const id = pm.response.json().data?.id;",
                  "  if (id) pm.collectionVariables.set('categoryId', id);",
                  "}"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "List categories",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/businesses/{{businessId}}/expense-categories",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["businesses", "{{businessId}}", "expense-categories"]
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Update category",
          "request": {
            "method": "PATCH",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"name\": \"Rent Updated\",\n  \"description\": \"Studio rent\",\n  \"isActive\": false\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/businesses/{{businessId}}/expense-categories/:categoryId",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["businesses", "{{businessId}}", "expense-categories", ":categoryId"],
              "query": [
                { "key": "categoryId", "value": "{{categoryId}}" }
              ]
            },
            "description": "Auth: Bearer + membership + FINANCE_RECORD_EXPENSE"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "3. Expense — Ledger",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Record expense",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"branchId\": \"{{branchId}}\",\n  \"categoryId\": \"{{categoryId}}\",\n  \"amount\": 500,\n  \"amountPaid\": 500,\n  \"expenseDate\": \"2026-10-15T10:00:00.000+03:00\",\n  \"dueDate\": \"2026-10-22\",\n  \"vendor\": \"Ethiopia Utilities\",\n  \"receiptNumber\": \"REC-1001\",\n  \"description\": \"Monthly utilities\",\n  \"notes\": \"Paid by bank transfer\",\n  \"paymentMethodId\": \"{{paymentMethodId}}\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/businesses/{{businessId}}/expenses",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["businesses", "{{businessId}}", "expenses"]
            },
            "description": "Auth: Bearer + membership + FINANCE_RECORD_EXPENSE\n\n`amountPaid` may be omitted (UNPAID). Cannot exceed `amount`. Status derived server-side: UNPAID / PARTIALLY_PAID / PAID."
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "if (responseCode.code === 201) {",
                  "  const id = pm.response.json().data?.id;",
                  "  if (id) pm.collectionVariables.set('expenseId', id);",
                  "}"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "List expenses",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/businesses/{{businessId}}/expenses?from=2026-10-01&to=2026-10-31&branchId={{branchId}}&status=UNPAID&page=1&limit=20",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["businesses", "{{businessId}}", "expenses"],
              "query": [
                { "key": "from", "value": "2026-10-01" },
                { "key": "to", "value": "2026-10-31" },
                { "key": "branchId", "value": "{{branchId}}" },
                { "key": "status", "value": "UNPAID" },
                { "key": "page", "value": "1" },
                { "key": "limit", "value": "20" }
              ]
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Get expense",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/businesses/{{businessId}}/expenses/{{expenseId}}",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["businesses", "{{businessId}}", "expenses", "{{expenseId}}"]
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Update expense",
          "request": {
            "method": "PATCH",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"amount\": 750,\n  \"description\": \"Updated rent description\",\n  \"expenseDate\": \"2026-10-16T10:00:00.000+03:00\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/businesses/{{businessId}}/expenses/{{expenseId}}",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["businesses", "{{businessId}}", "expenses", "{{expenseId}}"]
            },
            "description": "Auth: Bearer + membership + FINANCE_RECORD_EXPENSE\n\n`amount` cannot go below `amountPaid`. `amountPaid` itself is NOT settable here — use payments."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Record payment",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"amount\": 100,\n  \"paidAt\": \"2026-10-15T11:30:00.000+03:00\",\n  \"paymentMethodId\": \"{{paymentMethodId}}\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/businesses/{{businessId}}/expenses/{{expenseId}}/payments",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["businesses", "{{businessId}}", "expenses", "{{expenseId}}", "payments"]
            },
            "description": "Auth: Bearer + membership + FINANCE_RECORD_EXPENSE\n\nSupports partial payments; cannot push `amountPaid` past `amount`."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Void expense",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"reason\": \"Duplicate entry\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/businesses/{{businessId}}/expenses/{{expenseId}}/void",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["businesses", "{{businessId}}", "expenses", "{{expenseId}}", "void"]
            },
            "description": "Auth: Bearer + membership + FINANCE_RECORD_EXPENSE\n\nSoft delete: VOIDED + voidedAt + voidReason. Idempotent. Excluded from all finance reports."
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "4. Finance Reports (GET-only)",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Summary",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/businesses/{{businessId}}/finance/summary?from=2026-10-01&to=2026-10-31&branchId={{branchId}}",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["businesses", "{{businessId}}", "finance", "summary"],
              "query": [
                { "key": "from", "value": "2026-10-01" },
                { "key": "to", "value": "2026-10-31" },
                { "key": "branchId", "value": "{{branchId}}" }
              ]
            },
            "description": "Auth: Bearer + membership + FINANCE_VIEW | FINANCE_VIEW_REPORTS | REPORT_VIEW\n\nSummary: totalRevenue, totalPaymentsCollected, totalRefunds, totalOutstanding, totalExpenses, totalExpensesPaid, totalExpensesUnpaid, netOperatingResult (= revenue − incurred), netCashMovement (= collected − refunds − expensesPaid), revenueBasis=EARNED, plus byBranch / byService / byPaymentMethod / byExpenseCategory / byDate."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Revenue",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/businesses/{{businessId}}/finance/revenue?from=2026-10-01&to=2026-10-31",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["businesses", "{{businessId}}", "finance", "revenue"],
              "query": [
                { "key": "from", "value": "2026-10-01" },
                { "key": "to", "value": "2026-10-31" }
              ]
            },
            "description": "Revenue = SUM(finalAgreedAmount) of COMPLETED appointments on completedAt (earned basis)."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Collections",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/businesses/{{businessId}}/finance/collections?from=2026-10-01&to=2026-10-31&branchId={{branchId}}",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["businesses", "{{businessId}}", "finance", "collections"],
              "query": [
                { "key": "from", "value": "2026-10-01" },
                { "key": "to", "value": "2026-10-31" },
                { "key": "branchId", "value": "{{branchId}}" }
              ]
            },
            "description": "Collections = verified payments (PAID / PARTIALLY_REFUNDED / REFUNDED) on paidAt. netCollected = collected − completedRefunds."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Refunds",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/businesses/{{businessId}}/finance/refunds?from=2026-10-01&to=2026-10-31&branchId={{branchId}}",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["businesses", "{{businessId}}", "finance", "refunds"],
              "query": [
                { "key": "from", "value": "2026-10-01" },
                { "key": "to", "value": "2026-10-31" },
                { "key": "branchId", "value": "{{branchId}}" }
              ]
            },
            "description": "Refund report: only COMPLETED refunds count as cash out (completedRefundAmount/completedRefundCount). byStatus shows requested vs approved per PENDING/APPROVED/REJECTED/COMPLETED."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Outstanding",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/businesses/{{businessId}}/finance/outstanding?branchId={{branchId}}&page=1&limit=20",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["businesses", "{{businessId}}", "finance", "outstanding"],
              "query": [
                { "key": "branchId", "value": "{{branchId}}" },
                { "key": "page", "value": "1" },
                { "key": "limit", "value": "20" }
              ]
            },
            "description": "Current snapshot: only appointments with outstanding > 0, paginated (DB COUNT + LIMIT/OFFSET). Row figures come from the canonical getAppointmentFinancials (outstanding = GREATEST(finalAgreedAmount − verifiedPaid, 0))."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Expenses",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/businesses/{{businessId}}/finance/expenses?from=2026-10-01&to=2026-10-31&branchId={{branchId}}",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["businesses", "{{businessId}}", "finance", "expenses"],
              "query": [
                { "key": "from", "value": "2026-10-01" },
                { "key": "to", "value": "2026-10-31" },
                { "key": "branchId", "value": "{{branchId}}" }
              ]
            },
            "description": "Expense report: incurred (amount), paid (amountPaid), unpaid split, byCategory / byBranch / byDate. VOIDED expenses excluded."
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "5. Refunds — Admin Queue",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "List refund requests",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/businesses/{{businessId}}/refund-requests?status=PENDING&page=1&limit=20",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["businesses", "{{businessId}}", "refund-requests"],
              "query": [
                { "key": "status", "value": "PENDING" },
                { "key": "page", "value": "1" },
                { "key": "limit", "value": "20" }
              ]
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Get refund request",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/businesses/{{businessId}}/refund-requests/{{refundRequestId}}",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["businesses", "{{businessId}}", "refund-requests", "{{refundRequestId}}"]
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Approve refund",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/businesses/{{businessId}}/refund-requests/{{refundRequestId}}/approve",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["businesses", "{{businessId}}", "refund-requests", "{{refundRequestId}}", "approve"]
            },
            "description": "Auth: Bearer + membership + branch scope.\n\nIdempotent. PENDING→APPROVED. APPROVED→same record. REJECTED→400. Sets approvedAmount (default = requestedAmount), reviewedAt, reviewedById. Sends approval SMS (best effort)."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Reject refund",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"rejectionReason\": \"Service was already fully delivered\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/businesses/{{businessId}}/refund-requests/{{refundRequestId}}/reject",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["businesses", "{{businessId}}", "refund-requests", "{{refundRequestId}}", "reject"]
            },
            "description": "Auth: Bearer + membership + branch scope.\n\nAPPROVED→REJECTED. REJECTED→same record (idempotent). COMPLETED→400. rejectionReason required."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Get refundable balance",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/businesses/{{businessId}}/appointments/{{appointmentId}}/refundable",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["businesses", "{{businessId}}", "appointments", "{{appointmentId}}", "refundable"]
            },
            "description": "Auth: Bearer + membership + branch scope.\n\nCanonical financial state for the appointment: originalAmount, finalAgreedAmount, finalized, verifiedPaid, outstanding, refunded, refundReserved, refundable. Policy resolution: override → appointment snapshot → branch config."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Create refund request",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"appointmentId\": \"{{appointmentId}}\",\n  \"amount\": 200,\n  \"paymentId\": \"{{paymentId}}\",\n  \"reason\": \"Customer cancellation\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/businesses/{{businessId}}/refund-requests",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["businesses", "{{businessId}}", "refund-requests"]
            },
            "description": "Auth: Bearer + membership + branch scope.\n\nValidation: appointment belongs to business; status CANCELLED / NO_SHOW / COMPLETED; requestedAmount > 0 and <= refundable; paymentId (if given) belongs to appointment and is not VOIDED."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Complete refund",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"amount\": 200,\n  \"reference\": \"TB-PAY-88123\",\n  \"note\": \"Transferred to account 12345\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/businesses/{{businessId}}/refund-requests/{{refundRequestId}}/complete",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["businesses", "{{businessId}}", "refund-requests", "{{refundRequestId}}", "complete"]
            },
            "description": "Auth: Bearer + membership + branch scope.\n\nOnly APPROVED requests can be completed. Moves money: applies amount to verified payments (oldest first), status → COMPLETED, completedAt, completedById. amount cannot exceed approvedAmount."
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "6. Reference — Canonical Money & Outstanding",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Get appointment financials",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/businesses/{{businessId}}/appointments/{{appointmentId}}/financials",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["businesses", "{{businessId}}", "appointments", "{{appointmentId}}", "financials"]
            },
            "description": "Auth: Bearer + membership + branch scope.\n\nOne canonical calculation reused by the reports and the outstanding endpoint: verifiedPaid, outstanding, refunded, refundable."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Get customer outstanding",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/businesses/{{businessId}}/customers/{{customerId}}/outstanding",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["businesses", "{{businessId}}", "customers", "{{customerId}}", "outstanding"]
            },
            "description": "Auth: Bearer + membership + branch scope.\n\nAggregated across finalized appointments: totalOutstanding, totalPaid, totalRefunded, plus per-appointment breakdown."
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "7. Conventions",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Time Handling",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/health",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["health"]
            },
            "description": "Health check. Use as a no-token sanity check for the base URL."
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
